('127.888.d.18.L',3,'A student traces the servos, computer and control panel of an autopilot and an auto-throttle. She is:','["describing tires", "describing seats", "identifying the components and explaining the basic operation of autopilot and auto-throttle systems", "avoiding autopilot"]'::jsonb,2,'Autopilot.','original'),
('127.888.d.18.L',4,'An autopilot servo''s job is to:','["cool the cabin", "fuel the aircraft", "steer the nose wheel only", "move a control surface as the autopilot commands"]'::jsonb,3,'Servo.','original'),
('127.888.d.18.M',3,'A mechanic learns that testing an ELT on the wrong schedule can send a false alert to rescuers. She is researching:','["the risks of improper ELT testing procedures", "no risks", "ELT labels", "ELT paint"]'::jsonb,0,'ELT testing.','original'),
