('127.888.d.18.O',4,'An antenna that is poorly bonded can cause:','["better range", "static noise and weak reception", "clearer reception", "less drag"]'::jsonb,1,'Bonding.','original'),
('127.888.d.19.A',3,'A mechanic opens the manual to the autopilot inspection section before checking servos and linkage. She is:','["guessing", "painting servos", "locating and explaining autopilot inspection procedures", "ignoring the manual"]'::jsonb,2,'Autopilot inspection.','original'),
('127.888.d.19.A',4,'A normal autopilot inspection includes checking that the system can be:','["jammed", "ignored", "never turned off", "disconnected quickly by the pilot"]'::jsonb,3,'Autopilot disconnect.','original'),
('127.888.d.19.B',3,'A student points to the blade, whip and flush antennas on an aircraft and names each one''s purpose. She is:','["identifying navigation and communication antennas", "identifying seats", "identifying lights", "identifying tires"]'::jsonb,0,'Antennas.','original'),
('127.888.d.19.B',4,'A GPS antenna is usually mounted:','["under the seat", "on top of the fuselage with a clear view of the sky", "on the tire", "inside the engine"]'::jsonb,1,'GPS antenna.','original'),
('127.888.d.19.C',3,'A mechanic keys the mic on a test frequency and gets a clear response from a ground station. She is:','["avoiding radios", "painting the radio", "performing an operational check of a VHF communications system", "ignoring the check"]'::jsonb,2,'VHF check.','original'),
('127.888.d.19.C',4,'Before an operational check, a technician should confirm that the frequency chosen is:','["an emergency channel", "any random one", "a tower frequency in use", "a legal test frequency that won''t interfere with others"]'::jsonb,3,'Test frequency.','original'),
